OL,3,AI was fired from The Voice - I didn't
OL,4,Awant to leave, says Sir Tom Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones has said ITV "fired" him
OL,7,Fas a judge on The Voice, and he did not
OL,8,Fwant to leave as he "loves the show".
OL,10,FThe 86-year-old singer from Treforest
OL,11,Fin Pontypridd, Rhondda Cynon Taf, has
OL,12,Fappeared as an on-off coach on the
OL,13,Fsinging competition since it premiered
OL,14,Fin 2012.
OL,16,FFollowing rumours that he may not
OL,17,Freturn to the panel for the upcoming
OL,18,Fseries, Sir Tom said the broadcaster
OL,19,Fdecided a while ago, but he "was told
OL,20,Frecently".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
